#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use the Qiskit Estimator and Sampler backend primitives."
msgstr "Cara menggunakan primitif Backend Estimator dan Sampler Qiskit."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with the backend primitives"
msgstr "Mulakan dengan primitif Backend"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with the backend primitives {#get-started-with-the-backend-primitives}"
msgstr "Mulakan dengan primitif Backend {#get-started-with-the-backend-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unlike provider-specific primitives, backend primitives are generic implementations that can be used with an arbitrary\n"
"`backend` object, as long as it implements the [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) interface.  Some providers implement primitives natively.  See the [Qiskit Ecosystem page](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem?tag=provider) for details.\n"
msgstr "Tidak seperti primitif khusus penyedia, primitif Backend adalah implementasi generik yang boleh digunakan dengan objek `backend` mana-mana, selagi ia melaksanakan antara muka [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2). Sesetengah penyedia mengimplementasikan primitif secara asli. Lihat [halaman Ekosistem Qiskit](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem?tag=provider) untuk butiran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"estimator\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"estimator\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with the Estimator backend primitive {#get-started-with-the-estimator-backend-primitive}"
msgstr "Mulakan dengan primitif Backend Estimator {#get-started-with-the-estimator-backend-primitive}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Estimator primitive can be run with any provider by using the [`qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2) class. However, it offers no measurement or gate error mitigation implementations \"out-of-the-box\", as backend primitives are designed to run locally in the user's machine.\n"
msgstr "Primitif Estimator boleh dijalankan dengan mana-mana penyedia menggunakan kelas [`qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BackendEstimatorV2). Walau bagaimanapun, ia tidak menawarkan implementasi pengurangan ralat pengukuran atau gate \"out-of-the-box\", kerana primitif Backend direka untuk berjalan secara tempatan dalam mesin pengguna.\n"

